# Birth, karma, curse and the divine
#
# These are what the story tells, never checked against the world. Each birth has its own id.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m17_cosmology> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Birth, karma, curse and the divine" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E5_Event

iy:Birth a owl:Class .
iy:Curse a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Prophecy a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Speech .
iy:Miracle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Capability a owl:Class .

iy:earlierBirthOf a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:fulfils a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:capableOf a owl:ObjectProperty .
